    "body": "I suspect what this should capture is what happens if the attribute is not specified. E.g., if you do not specify `type` on `<ol>` it's as if you wrote `<ol type=1>`, per https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/grouping-content.html#attr-ol-type. We could call this column \"Value when omitted\" or some such. I hope I captured @fantasai's proposal correctly with that.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
