    "created_at": "2018-03-27T21:37:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-03-27T21:37:12Z",
    "body": "Looking at this again, it seems like some of the attributes already show the default value?\r\n\r\nText values for attributes like `label` and `id` are empty by default, and boolean attributes like `async` are false when omitted.\r\n\r\nSome attributes like `tabindex` do have default values (0 for elements that are focusable and -1 for those that are not). Would this information go under the value column or somewhere else altogether?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
