    "created_at": "2018-03-30T03:54:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-03-30T03:54:54Z",
    "body": "I think what might make sense here is a column for invalid value default, and a column for missing value default. That only applies to enumerated attributes, but I'm not sure it's well-defined for anything else.\r\n\r\nE.g., tabindex does not default to 0 or -1; 0 or -1 trigger specific behaviors that are different than the defaults.",
